you spontaneously had to throw up.

261
00:15:39,082 --> 00:15:41,957
Vomited over the poor
man.

262
00:15:42,249 --> 00:15:46,457
Fully covered him from top to
bottom-, totally fouled him up.

263
00:15:46,541 --> 00:15:48,166
