264
00:15:48,291 --> 00:15:52,457
Tommie only spat a
tiny bit.

265
00:15:53,041 --> 00:15:55,832
Exactly. And then he
looked at me quite cheekily.

266
00:15:56,332 --> 00:16:00,832
Si. He probably wanted to say
something like insulting an officer.

267
00:16:01,457 --> 00:16:04,082
100%. I saw it exactly.

268
00:16:04,124 --> 00:16:08,124
Strange. Really very strange.

269
00:16:11,624 --> 00:16:13,374
Mr. Bartolo, Mr. Krause.

270
00:16:13,582 --> 00:16:16,957
