a Doberman on him.

288
00:17:11,166 --> 00:17:14,166
Ey, wait, wait, wait. It
has to be even worse.

289
00:17:14,249 --> 00:17:15,790
Si, much worse.

290
00:17:15,874 --> 00:17:17,249
Ey, much, much worse.

291
00:17:17,249 --> 00:17:20,707
