308
00:19:03,874 --> 00:19:05,707
Tommie, he's wild.

309
00:19:05,874 --> 00:19:08,249
Ey, let him be, let him be.

310
00:19:08,541 --> 00:19:09,541
Ow.

311
00:19:09,582 --> 00:19:11,373
Ey, watch out,
watch out, watch out.

312
00:19:11,416 --> 00:19:12,749
