411
00:25:53,082 --> 00:25:54,248
How did it happen?

412
00:25:54,332 --> 00:25:57,123
How did this mess
happen? How did it happen?

413
00:25:59,124 --> 00:26:03,290
Crooks were in a hurry...

414
00:26:03,957 --> 00:26:06,207
and just ran off like that?

415
