can't do it.

451
00:28:14,082 --> 00:28:17,832
And because you believe that
these men are returning to your life?

452
00:28:18,457 --> 00:28:20,873
These two men
who kill all your pets?

453
00:28:21,082 --> 00:28:25,415
- Mhm.

454
00:28:25,791 --> 00:28:29,166
