and everywhere only cause terrible havoc.

455
00:28:29,666 --> 00:28:30,666
Exactly.

456
00:28:35,082 --> 00:28:37,498
Intestinal obstruction, third
stage. We must act immediately.

457
00:28:37,582 --> 00:28:38,582
Si, si.

458
