500
00:31:33,707 --> 00:31:36,165
Ey, Mario. She's got
a super pump, right?

501
00:31:36,207 --> 00:31:37,207
Yes.

502
00:31:39,541 --> 00:31:44,041
Tommie, listen. There's even a
fur, if you tickle, it sounded good.

503
00:31:46,624 --> 00:31:48,582
Ey, wait. I'll give
