01:16:49,291 --> 01:16:50,291
Awesome!

1257
01:16:50,874 --> 01:16:52,999
Tell me guys, how
did the police

1258
01:16:52,999 --> 01:16:54,332
chief actually find you?

1259
01:16:54,499 --> 01:16:57,749
We had to
inspect his exhaust.

1260
01:16:58,124 --> 01:17:00,165
Exactly, because it
had been loose.

1261
01:17:01,624 --> 01:17:05,374
Well. Anyway. The man
really hit the bullseye there.

1262
01:17:05,916 --> 01:17:06,916
Cheers!

1263
01:17:10,124 --> 01:17:11,499
And one thing I can
assure you.

1264
01:17:12,124 --> 01:17:14,707
You two will never be police officers.

1265
01:17:17,249 --> 01:17:19,374
Ey, the old lady, she's
got no clue, ey.

1266
01:17:19,749 --> 01:17:21,582
Si. This stupid cow.

1267
01:17:21,916 --> 01:17:23,457
Ey, they'll get it back.

1268
01:17:23,541 --> 01:17:25,082
You didn't do that
for nothing.

1269
01:17:25,124 --> 01:17:26,124
No!

1270
01:17:26,291 --> 01:17:27,332
Ey, you know what?

1271
01:17:27,874 --> 01:17:29,749
For that we're taking
the exhaust with us.

1272
01:17:30,832 --> 01:17:33,873
Si, Tommie. At least we ain't
coming home with empty hands.

1273
01:17:34,582 --> 01:17:35,582
Exactly.

1274
01:17:44,041 --> 01:17:46,041
Ey, this thing's totally sick, right.

1275
01:17:46,249 --> 01:17:49,082
And the best part is, there's two
of 'em, man. Everyone gets one.

1276
01:17:55,582 --> 01:17:59,832
- Come out.
- One, two, three.

1277
01:18:00,124 --> 01:18:01,124
Come out.

1278
01:18:01,707 --> 01:18:03,665
Hey! You there.

1279
01:18:03,874 --> 01:18:05,124
I don't believe it!

1280
01:18:06,624 --> 01:18:07,832
What on earth are you doing there?

1281
01:18:12,166 --> 01:18:14,666
What is it?
What am I doing?

1282
01:18:19,499 --> 01:18:20,582
Are you not feeling well?

1283
01:18:22,374 --> 01:18:24,540
Come. Sit down.

1284
01:18:26,416 --> 01:18:29,041
<i>Can I help you in any way,
Mr. Police Commissioner?</i>

1285
01:18:31,499 --> 01:18:34,707
Wait, I'll get
you a glass of water, yeah?

1286
01:18:36,499 --> 01:18:37,499
Hello.

1287
01:18:39,124 --> 01:18:40,124
<i>Hello?</i>

1288
01:18:41,166 --> 01:18:44,957
Oh, Mr. President. Yes. Sorry,
I didn't want to disturb you.

1289
01:18:44,957 --> 01:18:46,290
But your secretary said

1290
01:18:46,291 --> 01:18:49,416
you had a few urgent
personnel recommendations for me.

1291
01:18:49,416 --> 01:18:50,416
<i>- Hello?</i>
- Yes.

1292
01:18:51,124 --> 01:18:53,374
Uh, do you perhaps already
have the names ready?

1293
01:18:53,791 --> 01:18:55,457
- Names?
- Yes, the...

1294
01:18:57,082 --> 01:18:58,082
...the names.

1295
01:18:58,124 --> 01:19:00,040
Tommie Krause.

1296
01:19:00,541 --> 01:19:03,207
Mario Bartolo.

1297
01:19:03,582 --> 01:19:04,582
Mhm.

1298
01:19:39,749 --> 01:19:40,749
Look there.

1299
01:19:47,166 --> 01:19:49,666
Finally normal people!

1300
01:19:55,749 --> 01:19:57,374
You aliens,

1301
01:19:57,999 --> 01:19:59,082
I'm calling you!

1302
01:20:00,082 --> 01:20:04,582
Take me with you to your
planet. I am ready. I am ready.

1303
01:20:13,374 --> 01:20:17,207
FC, FC, FC...

1304
01:20:17,499 --> 01:20:20,957
FC, FC, F...

1305
01:20:22,291 --> 01:20:23,291
Tell me.

1306
01:20:23,457 --> 01:20:26,373
Well, blow me.
Who do we have here?

1307
01:20:28,707 --> 01:20:33,207
Schalke 04 plays
better than 1. FC Köln.

1308
01:20:33,957 --> 01:20:38,457
Played much better. Played wonderful.
Schalke 04 will become champion.

1309
01:20:39,416 --> 01:20:40,957
And we are not worthy.

1310
01:20:40,999 --> 01:20:42,582
No, not worthy.

1311
01:20:42,582 --> 01:20:43,957
We are not worthy.

1312
01:20:43,999 --> 01:20:45,040
Not worthy.

1313
01:20:45,124 --> 01:20:46,832
...to be at Schalke.

1314
01:20:47,041 --> 01:20:51,541
Because we've got no ass on our
flag, there is a solution for everything.

1315
01:21:05,874 --> 01:21:06,874
Oh, uh.

1316
01:21:07,541 --> 01:21:08,541
No, uh.

